{"chapter": "guide", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03B6", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": "\n\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9719074ea5d71afa20d68f677e50f8376b78f340e56b9c2a7ad000f7ff7b0999", "source_text": "Below is a list of research papers which contain fundamental results on stacks and algebraic spaces. The intention of the summaries is to indicate only the results of the paper which contribute toward stack theory; in many cases these results are subsidiary to the main goals of the paper. We divide the papers into categories with some papers falling into multiple categories.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4fa667311a1cfb92ab60c74bfbb5eb59425519a2e1f88abc5d399b8fa9ab7ca8", "unit_id": "tag:03B6:p001"}
